WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:06.940
<i>The overwhelming power of III's new Number, Atlantal, is striking me relentlessly.</i>

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.390
<i>Although Astral has vanished, he still lives within my heart!</i>

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.830
<i>I can't afford to lose this duel!</i>

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.590
Now you only have 200 LP left.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.270
Let me finish you off now, Yuma!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.460
I set 2 cards face-down, and end my turn!

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:30.850
I won't give up, for the sake of Astral who entrusted hope to me!

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.300
My turn, draw!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.690
<i>See for yourself, Astral, this is my </i>real<i> duel now!</i>

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.070
<i>This... is the other power you left for me.</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.830
<i>I will not waste it!</i>

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.770
<i>I'll bring it to 'Em!</i>

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.290
When my LP are lower than 1000, I can use Aspiring Emperor Hope as Overlay material,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:55.430
CHAOS XYZ CHANGE!!

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.600
Show yourself, Chaos No.39!

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.430
The messenger who turns chaos into light, Aspiring Emperor Hope Ray!

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.330
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:16.380
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:23.640
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:32.900
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:37.400
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:43.860
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:48.660
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:54.330
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:59.590
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.470
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:05.760
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:10.930
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.520
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.690
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:22.240
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.740
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.740
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:34.540
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.890
Here it comes! Hope Ray!

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.060
Cat it to 'Em, Yuma!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:50.810
So it finally comes huh...

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:53.730
"Numbers 49: The End of a Fierce Fight! 
Hope Ray VS Atlanthal"

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:57.990
<i>Hope Ray, your power definitely can bring III back to his senses.</i>

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.160
I activate the effect of Overlay Eater from my graveyard!

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.700
By banishing this card from my graveyard, it can absorb one overlay unit from my opponent's Xyz monster,

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.330
and attach it to my own Xyz monster!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.350
Nice! Now Atlantal cannot use his effect!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:28.180
Here I come! I activate Hope Ray's effect!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:34.110
For every Overlay Unit I detached this turn, he gains 500 ATK,

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:39.940
I will detach all 3 Overlay Units from Hope Ray!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.360
OVERLAY CHARGE!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:53.500
Also due to this effect, for every Overlay Unit detached, Atlantal loses 1000 ATK!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.590
Astral no longer exists, so why...?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.420
No! He still exists!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.050
He lives within my heart!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.430
He lives within my 'Bring it to 'Em'!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.260
And keeps making me strong!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.350
Go, Aspiring Emperor Hope Ray!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.100
This level of counterattack, I already foresaw it!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.070
Trap activate! Thunder Pot!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:24.700
This card negates the attack that targets an OOParts monster, and ends the Battle Phase!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.530
Ah... Hope Ray!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.160
Ah! Yuma's attack was...

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.790
How can this be?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:36.210
Seems like even Hope Ray's attack won't be able to hit me.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.340
Tch! It's not over yet!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.340
It's too soon for me to give up!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.630
I set one card, and end my turn!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.890
You are quite persistent, Yuma!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.100
Now our monster's ATK has returned to normal.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.180
You still have no chance of winning!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:54.850
My turn.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:55.690
Dra -...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.280
<i>So </i>that's<i> what Tron's been talking about...</i>

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.530
<i>Listen well, III.</i>

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.240
<i>After obtaining this Crests power,</i>

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:11.910
<i>you shall be able to control No.6 Atlantal.</i>

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.000
<i>But while this card gives you enormous power,</i>

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.840
<i>it will also take a huge toll on your mind and body.</i>

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.760
<i>No... no problem!</i>

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:29.220
<i>I will defeat Yuma to meet your expectation!</i>

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.140
<i>I have faith in you, III.</i>

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.600
<i>Because you are such a strong child.</i>

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.070
<i>Is this the price of using Numbers?</i>

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:48.280
<i>Don't tell me I am still unable to control the Number?</i>

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:54.700
I...I will definitely meet Tron's expectation!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.040
Wha...what's happening to that guy?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Here I come, Yuma! Draw!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.550
Wha...what happened?

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:26.690
While it has no Overlay Units, during my Standby Phase, Atlantal halves each player's LP!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.000
That guy...he is willing to cut down his own LP...

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.540
Yuma...

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:49.300
Not yet... I still have some LP remaining, III!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.820
III...you...that's...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.160
III...

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:13.990
III...!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:15.870
Don't come here!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.330
Forget about me, Yuma.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.830
This is the price of the power I seek!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.460
But even if I will perish...

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.930
I...I will still protect my family for sure!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:32.890
You...

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.890
I will defeat you with this attack!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.930
Go, Atlantal!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:43.440
Attack Hope Ray! 
DIVINE PUNISHMENT!!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.940
Shoot! If this attack connects, then Yuma-kun will lose!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.650
Trap activate! Battle Break!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.620
When my opponent's monster declares an attack,

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.950
this card ends the battle phase, and destroys the attacking monster!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:00.000
What?!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:02.750
Trap - ...

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.630
<i>I can't believe you actually endured all that III, so as promised,</i>

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.300
<i>I will give the Number and </i>this<i> card to you.</i>

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.260
<i>Angolmois...</i>

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:18.600
<i>Tron... this Trap card is...</i>

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.850
<i>Just treat it as your Lucky Charm.</i>

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.390
<i>This card is the Card of Destruction.</i>

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.230
<i>After its activation, I guess both you and your opponent won't be safe anymore...</i>

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.610
<i>Just in case, I decided to entrust this card to you as insurance.</i>

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:33.700
<i>Tron...</i>

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.910
<i>you will win using whatever means necessary, right?</i>

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:39.950
<i>...against Yuma.</i>

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.500
I activate the Continuous Trap, Angolmois!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.930
With this card I can destroy one Equip card on my field,

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.390
then it negates the activation of my opponent's trap card and destroys it.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:00.600
What?!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:04.520
To destroy my trap, he's even willing to lower Atlantal's ATK!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:10.570
One strike will be enough! After all, you only have 100 LP left!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.320
Resume the attack, Atlantal!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:15.910
Blow Hope Ray out along with Yuma!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.950
Trap activate! Half Unbreak!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.410
This card protects Hope Ray from being destroyed by battle,

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.120
while halve the damage is inflicted to the player!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.880
Yuma...
He only has 50 LP remaining...

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.140
Yuma... you are still struggling?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.070
III!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:00.280
III... you...

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:05.790
I... I will let you to witness my true power.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.040
Enough, stop it! III!

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:11.040
Haven't we already become friends?

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.420
Yuma... I don't need friends.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.130
I still wish to talk to you more!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.810
Talk to you about your family and my father!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:24.270
Yuma...

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:27.690
Thank you...

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.560
But... it's already too late.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.770
What do you mean?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:38.740
The Trap card I just activated, Angolmois, is the Card of Destruction.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:46.870
During my next turn, it will inflict damage to you and me, equal to the ATK of Machu Mach it destroyed.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:51.250
What?

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.790
Just what will happen?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:05.390
In other words, when my next turn comes, both of us will get blown off the field after receiving 2400 damage.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:10.140
But it won't be a simple draw.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:14.570
After all, this is an battle between Number holders.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.320
But, I won't mind...

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:21.780
If my sacrifice will satisfy Tron's expectation,

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.160
If I can get back my family, that is.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.620
III, you...

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.960
Hey! That darkness is approaching here!

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.500
It doesn't look good!

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.750
Te...Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>, this is just AR Vision,

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.960
How could such a thing happen in reality?

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.640
Th...this is...don't tell me...

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.520
It's reality?!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:02.530
Sh...shooot! - At this rate we will...

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.070
What should we do?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.200
Hey, III!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:13.790
S... strange... don't tell me the Dimension Gate has...

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.390
III!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:30.390
N... no...

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.270
<i>This is a card which will lead everything to destruction..</i>

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:38.400
My Crest power can't control it!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:52.290
Don't tell me Angolmois's power is capable of destroying the world?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.800
It seems that III used that card.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.310
It can't be....you gave that card to III?!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.860
Angolmois is the card to opens the door of Valian.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.610
Once it's activated, it shall become unstoppable.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.900
Hey, III! What on earth is going on here?

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.830
This duel, at this rate, will open the gate that connects the Different Dimension!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:34.460
You and I...no...virtually everything will get sucked inside!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.620
What did you say?

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.250
How can that be?

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:42.130
Help me! I don't want that to happen!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:48.050
I....I don't wish to annihilate the world.

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.510
Forgive me, Yuma.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.350
I'll bring it to 'Em!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:00.610
You just said that at this rate the door of Different Dimension would open, right?

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:05.110
Then I will win this duel and prevent its opening!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:09.910
That's impossible. With Atlantal's effect, when my LP are 1000 or lower,

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:14.040
He cannot be destroyed by battle, and I take no battle damage.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.870
We are finished!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:22.460
Stop joking!! This duel is not over yet!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.670
It' s too soon to give up right now!

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:28.760
Right, if Astral were here, he would still think about how to win!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.510
Use ZeXal.

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.060
ZeXal?

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.770
That's the miraculous force summoned by Astral and me.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.230
But, he is...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:42.940
Yuma...

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.240
Yuma, there might be a way to call back Astral.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:49.910
Call Astral back?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.370
Astral has disappeared due to this Crest's power.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.700
In that case, if I pass on this power to you...!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.790
Then... which means... he will come back?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:04.840
But you might not be able to tame this Crest's power.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.920
And quite possibly, you might be engulfed by this power as well.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.680
I don't care! As long as I can get Astral back!

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.890
Come on, transfer your power to me!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.940
<i>Even if I successfully transfer the Crest Power to Yuma,</i>

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.690
<i>I am afraid I...</i>

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.440
III!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.790
...Astral!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:47.960
Yuma!

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:49.550
Yuma!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.430
How can I lose to the power of this Crest!

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:04.860
I'll bring it to 'Em!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:09.940
ASTRAL!

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.290
Astral.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.170
You are...

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:33.930
Astral, my son is calling for you. Please go help him.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:41.430
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.120
Yuma.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:00.080
Astral, you...

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:04.000
I heard your voice. Let's win this!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.580
You... you...

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.420
Geez, you always act tough!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:15.880
Yuma...

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.430
III!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:33.110
Yuma, Astral! Don't mind me, hurry up and defeat this guy!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.660
III!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.870
Yuma, use ZeXal!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.120
Sure. Let's go, Astral!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.410
I will overlay you and myself!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.710
With us both I will build an overlay network!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.420
Just what's going on?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:03.810
When two distant souls cross each other, the legendary power shall appear!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.060
Xyz Change!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:10.270
ZeXal!
ZeXal!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.940
Yuma fused with Astral?!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.320
Let's go, Astral!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.740
Everything from the strongest duelist's duel is predetermined!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:23.620
Even the draw shall be decided by the duelist as well!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.830
Shining Draw!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.750
Come, ZeXal Weapon!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.300
Phoenix Bow!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.880
This monster can be equipped to Hope Ray.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.840
When the equipped Hope Ray attacks,

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.260
the battle damage will be negated,

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:47.730
and 1000 damage will be inflicted to my opponent!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.740
Go, Hope Ray!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.830
Attack Atlantal!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:11.750
PHOENIX FINISH!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.730
So this is the bond between Yuma and Astral.

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.910
Impossible! III was...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:46.990
Tron...

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:56.800
I...

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.220
Oh... this is...

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.930
This is the place from before!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.970
Then, to summarize, we were saved!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.730
Did I... win?

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:12.230
Yuma.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.020
I said we would win.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:17.650
Astral...

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.900
Ri...right, III!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.660
III, III!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.540
Hey, are you alright?

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:34.290
You...

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:35.960
I understand, Yuma.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.760
You recognize the real me.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.300
You are my <i>first</i>, and <i>last</i> friend.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.550
III...

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:51.140
Yuma, I have a favor to ask from you. Can you save my family?

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:56.480
You can definitely do it, if someone can, it's you... with your 'Bring it to 'Em'.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.200
III...

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:09.490
Yuma!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.040
Now you got 5 Heart Pieces.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.750
You are qualified for the Final.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:20.460
Yuma?

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:24.840
III, I won't let your feelings go to waste...

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.140
I will win... the Duel Carnival!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:31.140
I'll bring it to 'Em

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.140
I'm sorry.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.520
It's alright, III.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.150
Can you please hold my hand?

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.400
I wish you could always hold it.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.910
Thank you... I feel quite tired.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:56.830
Good night...

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:02.340
I will remain by your side, so have a good sleep.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.130
Yuma Tsukumo...

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:07.380
Kazuma's son!

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:23.110
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.950
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.590
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:45.670
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.470
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.970
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:06.360
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:09.400
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:15.790
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.620
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.000
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.050
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.630
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:34.050
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.890
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.180
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:43.060
Finally, the Finals of WDC!!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:49.320
Duelists who past the preliminaries after surviving all kinds of intense battles, tonight, they will all gather in the Night Ceremony!

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:52.240
I brought Kotori and others with me.

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:55.240
The attendants are all strong duelists, don't let your guard down.

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:56.660
Ah. I got it.

00:23:57.240 --> 00:23:58.500
Eh? That guy is...

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:01.000
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:05.540
The Eve of the Storm! The Diabolical Duelist appears - Tron!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.090
Don't tell me he can see me?

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.050
Muzurhythm, Tenten Tempo, Mellowmellow Melody

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:17.810
Their effects will suit any tactical situation as the all are Rank 3.

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:20.770
I summon MuzuTenMelody Demon!

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:22.810
At least memorize the effects.
